  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project on Capacity Building for Forest and Urban Greening based on Smart Technology in Tashkent, Uzbekistan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Build smart greenhouse for container nursery, Pistachio seedling production, Develop ICT-based greenhouse for container nursery, Construction of production facility for landscape tree, Landscape tree production, Enhanced urban greening management capability</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To develop Uzbekistan&apos;s capacity-building to respond to climate change by establishing a sustaionsal forestry and urdan greeing business model using ICT-based smart container nursery technology&#xc0b0;&#xb9bc;&#xb179;&#xd654;&#xc13c;&#xd130;&#xb97c; &#xd1b5;&#xd55c; &#xc0b0;&#xb9bc;&#xbcf5;&#xc6d0;, &#xb3c4;&#xc2dc;&#xb179;&#xd654;&#xc13c;&#xd130;&#xb97c; &#xd1b5;&#xd55c; &#xb3c4;&#xc2dc;&#xb179;&#xd654;</narrative>
